cc-termux is an unofficial, community tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or supported by Anthropic.

Claude Code is a product of Anthropic PBC and is distributed under Anthropic's
terms. This project downloads the official package from the npm registry and runs
it unmodified by default. It does not redistribute the Claude Code binary.

The optional UI patches in bin/cc-patch.mjs modify bytes inside the locally installed
binary so the terminal UI matches this project's provider workflow. They are
disabled with CC_TERMUX_NO_UI_PATCH=1 and can be reverted with
`cc-termux patch revert`. Review Anthropic's terms before using patched builds.

